  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.2b">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIAtr">VII Atr</ref> 2.2b</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et apparetur III diebus corredium uniuscuiusque sine carne; in cibo et potu, sicut idem comedere deberet, (et) dividatur hoc totum pauperibus.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And everyone shall have his food served during the three days without meat, and whatever he would have consumed in food and drink shall be distributed among the poor.</ab>
      </div>
